export anchor HomeAIStyle:
    number: 379
    screen: SmartHome
    name: Home AI
    idea: The home speaks as a calm intelligence, a softly lit orb and one spoken line lead the screen, and the rooms, energy and scenes sit below as quiet notes the assistant is keeping an eye on.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #07060f, page ground
        deep: #0e0c1c, note panels and swatch cards
        veil: #151229, secondary buttons and fields
        line: #2a2548, panel edges and row rules
        ink: #ecebfa, text and the spoken line
        mute: #a7a3c7, labels and meta
        cyan: #9ee7ff, orb core, speaking status, lights on, focus
        lilac: #c7a8ff, energy curve, motion, active scene
        coral: #ffb3a1, the alert words in the spoken line, heating
        mint: #9df0cf, locked and battery
        onCyan: #061a24, text on the cyan to lilac primary button
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial, at light weights. Base 16px at 350. The spoken line is 30px
        at 300 and 1.4, figures 52px at 200, note ledes 19px at 300, meta
        14px muted, labels 12px at 600 caps with 0.22em tracking.
    layout:
        A violet black page with a soft radial haze behind the top. A thin
        caps line shows Brightwork Home and the day and time. The hero is
        centred, a 220px glowing orb with a pale core, cyan to violet body
        and two tilted orbit rings, then a cyan Speaking label with a mic,
        then one spoken sentence greeting the evening, saying Movie is on,
        with the garage sentence in coral and the question Shall I close it.
        A thin cyan waveform line runs under it, then a cyan to lilac pill
        Close now and a dark pill Leave it open. Below, three tall note
        panels with 32px corners sit side by side. Rooms has the lede Five
        places I am watching and five ruled rows with a coloured state icon,
        the room, a muted note and the value or state word. Energy has the
        lede A quiet day until the evening, a huge thin figure, solar and
        battery in cyan and mint, and a lilac filled curve with the peak
        dotted. Scenes has Ask me, or tap one, and four pill rows each with
        a voice hint, Movie edged lilac and marked Running with a check.
        Below 980px the third panel spans two columns, and at phone width
        the orb shrinks to 160px and panels stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit, very open. 56px between the hero and the notes, 24px panel padding.
    density: Low. One sentence leads and three short note panels follow.
    corners: 32px panels and full pills for every button, field and scene.
    borders: 1px #2a2548 on panels and rows, lilac on the active scene.
    shadows: None. Light comes from the orb glow and the radial haze behind it.
    icons: Thin 1.4 stroke line icons at 18px, coloured per state and always with words. A mic marks speaking.
    focus: A 2px cyan outline offset 4px.
    tone: First person and gentle, such as Five places I am watching and Shall I close it.
